## Label quality

- Recorded dispositions disagree with the latent true outcome on {{ s.label_vs_truth_disagreement | pct }} of accepted records. This is downstream test noise near the specification limit; it is irreducible and cannot be detected from the record. Headline metrics use the true outcome; training uses the recorded label.
